 CBBounce args;id;leaf;mk;t;avg
⍝ Shared callback for DemoBounce, dispatched on the source's leaf name:
⍝   TICK  - integrate positions, bounce off walls, push balls; stats every 15 ticks
⍝   RUN   - check-button: timer Active follows its State
⍝   ADD   - +10 balls (max 300), deterministic rebuild
⍝   SUB   - -10 balls (min 10), deterministic rebuild
⍝   RESET - back to 20 balls, stats cleared
⍝ State (BN_*) lives in #.demo. Field is 360x400, balls 14px, so centers
⍝ travel 0..346 vertically and 0..386 horizontally.

 mk←{i←⍳⍵ ⋄ (346|17×i)(386|23×i)(2+4|i)(3-6|i)}   ⍝ n → (Y X VY VX), no randomness

 id←⊃args
 leaf←{(1-(⌽⍵)⍳'.')↑⍵}id

 :Trap 0
     :Select leaf
     :Case 'TICK'
         t←⎕AI[3]                          ⍝ server-side tick timestamp (ms)
         :If BN_T>0
             BN_DT←¯30↑BN_DT,t-BN_T        ⍝ rolling window of tick round-trip deltas
         :EndIf
         BN_T←t ⋄ BN_TICKS+←1
         BN_Y+←BN_VY ⋄ BN_X+←BN_VX
         BN_VY×←1-2×(BN_Y≤0)∨BN_Y≥346 ⋄ BN_Y←0⌈346⌊BN_Y
         BN_VX×←1-2×(BN_X≤0)∨BN_X≥386 ⋄ BN_X←0⌈386⌊BN_X
         'F1.PF.BALLS'eWS('Points'(BN_Y BN_X))('Size'((BN_N⍴14)(BN_N⍴14)))
         :If (0=15|BN_TICKS)∧0<≢BN_DT      ⍝ stats labels ~once per second
             avg←(+/BN_DT)÷≢BN_DT
             'F1.FPS'eWS'Caption'('FPS: ',(1⍕1000÷1⌈avg)~' ')
             'F1.LAT'eWS'Caption'('Avg: ',(⍕⌈avg),' ms')
         :EndIf
     :Case 'RUN'
         BN_T←0                            ⍝ don't count the pause gap in the stats
         'F1.TICK'eWS'Active'(id eWG'State')
     :Case 'ADD'
         BN_N←300⌊BN_N+10
         →RESIZE
     :Case 'SUB'
         BN_N←10⌈BN_N-10
         →RESIZE
     :Case 'RESET'
         BN_N←20 ⋄ BN_DT←⍬ ⋄ BN_T←0 ⋄ BN_TICKS←0
         'F1.TICK'eWS'Active' 0
         'F1.RUN'eWS'State' 0
         'F1.FPS'eWS'Caption' 'FPS: —'
         'F1.LAT'eWS'Caption' 'Avg: — ms'
         →RESIZE
     :EndSelect
     →0
RESIZE:
     (BN_Y BN_X BN_VY BN_VX)←mk BN_N
     'F1.PF.BALLS'eWS('Points'(BN_Y BN_X))('Size'((BN_N⍴14)(BN_N⍴14)))('FillCol'(BN_N⍴BN_PAL))('FStyle'(BN_N⍴0))
     'F1.CNT'eWS'Caption'('Balls: ',⍕BN_N)
 :Else
     ⎕←'CBBounce: ',(⊃⎕DM),' (likely a late Timer tick after a demo switch)'
 :EndTrap
